# ── MentOrAI: allowlist for GitHub ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Track only product code + run config. Everything else stays local.

# Ignore all top-level entries by default
/*

# Keep product + docs needed to run / present the repo
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.env.example
!docker-compose.yml
!frontend/
!backend/
!deploy/

# ── Still ignore secrets & junk inside kept trees ───────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/*.pdf
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*~

# Local DB / uploads / dialog dumps (never commit user chats)
**/pgdata/
backend/data/uploads/
backend/data/dialogs/
backend/data/sessions/
